38:["$","h2","b1523",{"id":"frequently-asked-questions","className":"scroll-mt-28","children":["Frequently asked questions"]}]
39:["$","div","b1524",{"className":"faq-list my-10 flex flex-col divide-y divide-black/10 border-y border-black/10","children":[["$","details","0",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["How do I choose the right creative tools for my projects?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"Start from the jobs, not the brand names. You need a way to generate and edit visuals, a source of high-quality assets (photos, vectors, video, fonts), somewhere to organize everything, and a way to collaborate, then pick the fewest tools that cover all four. The common mistake is buying a separate subscription for each job. A platform like Melius folds generation, editing, asset management, and real-time collaboration onto one infinite canvas, so most of the stack collapses into a single tool."}]]}],["$","details","1",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["Can AI replace human creativity?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"No. AI generators clear away blank-page syndrome and the slow, mechanical parts of production, but taste, strategy, and emotional resonance stay human. Melius is built around that split: the platform handles the labor of execution so you keep the labor of taste."}]]}],["$","details","2",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["What are the best AI tools for graphic design?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"There is no single best tool or model, only the one that fits the job in front of you. Different models win at product photography, cinematic frames, text in images, or fast iteration, so the strongest setup is one that lets you switch between them. That is why Melius routes across every major image, video, and audio model instead of betting on one, so you can pick per job on the same canvas."}]]}],["$","details","3",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["How do I manage my digital assets?","$L47"]}],"$L48"]}],"$L49","$L4a"]}]
3a:["$","section","related",{"className":"relative w-full pb-section bg-gray-background","children":[["$","$L11",null,{"color":"gray"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-300 px-5 lg:px-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-h-2 mb-12 text-center text-balance text-gray-dark-1","children":"Related Articles"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto grid w-full max-w-max grid-cols-1 gap-11 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3","children":[["$","$L4b","post-higgsfield-alternative",{"post":{"_key":"post-higgsfield-alternative","slug":"higgsfield-alternative","category":"comparisons","title":"The best Higgsfield alternative for cinematic AI video","isoDate":"2026-07-21","date":"July 21, 2026","readTime":"6 Min Read","excerpt":"Looking for a Higgsfield alternative? Higgsfield nails cinematic camera motion, but teams outgrow its fixed roster and export-to-edit workflow. Here's an honest look at how Melius handles the same work, with every frontier model, an agent that plans multi-step pipelines, and a place to finish the cut.","image":{"url":"/images/blog/higgsfield-alternative/cover.webp"},"authors":[{"name":"Alex Chen, Member of Technical Staff"}],"faq":[{"question":"What is the best Higgsfield alternative?","answer":"For teams that want more than cinematic camera presets, Melius is the strongest alternative. It routes across every frontier video and image model (Kling, Veo, Sora, Seedance, Nano Banana Pro and more), adds Mel, an agent that plans and wires multi-step work on a shared canvas, supports real-time multiplayer, and keeps every model under one subscription with up to 8 seats on self-serve plans, unlimited seats on Enterprise, and unlimited agent usage instead of a fixed roster."},{"question":"Does Melius do cinematic camera motion like Higgsfield?","answer":"Melius routes to the same frontier video models that produce cinematic motion, so you describe the shot and Mel writes the per-model prompt each one responds to. Higgsfield's preset virtual camera rig is a genuine specialty, and if that exact preset-driven motion control is your entire workflow it is very good at it. The trade is model breadth and an in-app place to assemble the finished cut."},{"question":"Why do people look for a Higgsfield alternative?","answer":"The most commonly reported reasons are workflow friction: unlimited-mode jobs getting queued behind paid ones, and no in-app editing timeline, so clips get exported to Premiere, DaVinci or CapCut to assemble. Teams also outgrow a fixed model roster and want an agent that plans and runs multi-step work rather than a separate chat surface."},{"question":"Can I assemble a finished video in Melius?","answer":"Yes. Melius has an in-app multi-track editor, so you can generate shots, arrange them, layer audio and export from one place rather than exporting individual clips to a separate editor."},{"question":"Is Melius model-agnostic?","answer":"Yes. Melius runs every major image, video and audio model side by side and lets you pick the right one per shot. Its MCP server is canvas-level, so an external agent like Claude can build and run the canvas itself, not just request a single generation, which is a step beyond a generation-only integration."}],"tableOfContents":[{"_key":"what-higgsfield-does-well","title":"The specialty"},{"_key":"where-teams-hit-friction","title":"The friction"},{"_key":"how-melius-approaches-the-same-work","title":"The Melius approach"},{"_key":"who-should-switch","title":"Who should switch"},{"_key":"frequently-asked-questions","title":"FAQ"}],"content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b792","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b791","text":"Higgsfield earned its following with one thing done unusually well: cinematic camera motion. Its virtual camera rig, motion presets, and VFX library make it fast to turn a still into a crash-zoom, an orbit, or a stylized ad clip, and its Marketing Studio can spin a product URL into a finished spot. If that preset-driven look is the whole job, it is genuinely good at it.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b796","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b793","text":"But a lot of teams outgrow a tool built around one specialty. If you are searching for a ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b794","text":"Higgsfield alternative","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b795","text":", it is usually because you want the same frontier model quality without the roster limits or the export-and-assemble-elsewhere workflow, and with an agent that runs the whole pipeline. Here is an honest look at where Higgsfield shines, where teams hit friction, and how Melius approaches the same work.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b798","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b797","text":"What Higgsfield does well","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"what-higgsfield-does-well"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b800","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b799","text":"Credit where it is due. Higgsfield's camera-motion control is best-in-class, its Soul model keeps a character identity consistent across shots, and its preset and VFX library make polished social output quick. It has also expanded well beyond a single generate box, adding a node-based canvas, team collaboration, and an MCP server. For fast, cinematic ad creative, it is a capable tool.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b802","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b801","text":"Where teams hit friction","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"where-teams-hit-friction"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b804","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b803","text":"The recurring complaints are less about output and more about how the product is metered and where the workflow ends.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b807","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b805","text":"\"Unlimited\" that queues. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b806","text":"Users report that unlimited-mode jobs get throttled into a queue while credit-metered jobs run instantly.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b810","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b808","text":"No place to finish the cut. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b809","text":"There is no in-app editing timeline, so you export clips and assemble them in Premiere, DaVinci or CapCut.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b812","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b811","text":"How Melius approaches the same work","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"how-melius-approaches-the-same-work"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b814","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b813","text":"Melius is a creative workspace built around model choice and orchestration rather than one signature effect. You generate on a node-based canvas where every prompt, image, video clip and audio track is a connected node, and the output of one flows into the next.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b820","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b817","href":"/blog/one-subscription-every-model","isNewTab":false}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b815","text":"Every model, one credit pool. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b816","text":"Kling, Veo, Sora and Seedance for video; Nano Banana Pro, GPT Image and Seedream for images; ElevenLabs and Seed Audio for sound. You pick the right one per shot instead of being limited to a fixed roster, and ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b818","text":"every model draws from a single subscription","marks":["b817"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b819","text":" with up to 8 seats on self-serve plans, unlimited seats on Enterprise, and unlimited agent usage.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b826","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b823","href":"/blog/brief-to-execution-workflow","isNewTab":false}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b821","text":"An agent that operates the canvas. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b822","text":"Mel doesn't just generate next to your work. It reads the canvas, picks a model for each step, wires the nodes together and runs them, so a brief like \"product shot, then a five-second cinematic clip\" becomes a ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b824","text":"real brief-to-execution pipeline","marks":["b823"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b825","text":". Higgsfield's autonomous agent works as a separate chat surface that triggers its studios, rather than building and running the node graph itself.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b829","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b827","text":"Works where briefs land. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b828","text":"The same agent runs inside Slack, so someone can request a spot, review it, and download the finished cut in a thread. Most tools at best post outputs to Slack while the real work stays in their app.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b832","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b830","text":"A workforce, not one bot. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b831","text":"Run several agents at once, each claiming a visible region of the canvas so teammates can see who is working on what, with real-time multiplayer for the humans too.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b835","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b833","text":"Find every shot you've already made. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b834","text":"Every generation and upload is auto-indexed into a semantic asset library, so you pull back a past shot by describing what's in it instead of digging through folders, the kind of memory a preset-driven generator doesn't keep for you.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b838","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b836","text":"Drive it from your own tools, finish in one place. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b837","text":"The Melius MCP is canvas-level: an external agent like Claude can build and run the canvas itself, not just call a generation endpoint. And an in-app multi-track editor means you assemble the finished cut without leaving for Premiere or CapCut.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"portableTable","_key":"b839","rows":[{"_key":"b840","cells":[{"_key":"b841","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b843","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b842","text":"","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b844","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b846","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b845","text":"Melius","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b847","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b849","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b848","text":"Higgsfield","marks":["strong"]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b850","cells":[{"_key":"b851","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b853","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b852","text":"Core focus","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b854","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b856","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b855","text":"Agent-run creative workspace","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b857","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b859","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b858","text":"Cinematic video & ad creative","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b860","cells":[{"_key":"b861","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b863","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b862","text":"Model access","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b864","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b866","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b865","text":"Every major image, video & audio model","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b867","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b869","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b868","text":"Curated roster + proprietary models","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b870","cells":[{"_key":"b871","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b873","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b872","text":"Agent operates the canvas","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b874","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b876","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b875","text":"Builds & runs the nodes","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b877","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b879","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b878","text":"Separate chat agent","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b880","cells":[{"_key":"b881","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b883","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b882","text":"Agent in Slack","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b884","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b886","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b885","text":"Full workflow in a thread","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b887","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b889","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b888","text":"Posts outputs only","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b890","cells":[{"_key":"b891","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b893","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b892","text":"Multiple agents at once","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b894","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b896","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b895","text":"Yes, with visible presence","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b897","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b899","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b898","text":"One at a time","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b900","cells":[{"_key":"b901","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b903","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b902","text":"Canvas-level MCP","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b904","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b906","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b905","text":"Builds & runs the canvas","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b907","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b909","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b908","text":"Generation-only","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b910","cells":[{"_key":"b911","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b913","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b912","text":"Camera / motion control","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b914","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b916","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b915","text":"Prompt-driven","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b917","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b919","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b918","text":"Dedicated controls (a real strength)","marks":[]}]}]}]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b921","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b920","text":"Who should switch","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"who-should-switch"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b923","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b922","text":"If Higgsfield's camera rig and character models are the entire reason you're there, they are hard to beat on those axes. But if the bottleneck is throughput, turning briefs into finished, on-brand creative, then an agent that actually operates the canvas, works in Slack, runs many-at-once with visible presence, and is drivable from your own AI tools matters more than any single model knob. That is what Melius is built for.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b928","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b925","href":"https://app.melius.com","isNewTab":true}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b924","text":"See how your own shots break down across models. ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b926","text":"Open Melius","marks":["b925"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b927","text":".","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b930","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b929","text":"Frequently asked questions","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"frequently-asked-questions"},{"_type":"faqList","_key":"b931","items":"$3a:props:children:1:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:post:faq"}]}}],"$L4c","$L4d"]}]]}]]}]
