7:300
46:[["$","p","b1505",{"children":["Real-time multiplayer on the canvas"]}]]
47:["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]
48:["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"Use clear naming conventions, separate raw assets from working files and final exports, and lean on a Digital Asset Management (DAM) system so nothing gets lost. In Melius every generation, upload, and export lands in a searchable team asset library automatically, so organization happens as a byproduct of working rather than a separate chore."}]
49:["$","details","4",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["How do DAM tools support creative teams?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"A DAM keeps a team's images, video, fonts, and files tagged, versioned, and findable, so people spend time creating instead of hunting for the latest file. Melius goes further by putting that shared library on the same real-time, multiplayer canvas where the work is made, so generating, editing, commenting, and asset reuse all happen in one place."}]]}]
4a:["$","details","5",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["What is an AI design agent for creative workflows?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"It is an assistant that plans and carries out multi-step creative work, generating options, wiring them together, and editing, rather than answering one prompt at a time. In Melius the work lives on a shared canvas, and teams can connect their own external AI agents to it over MCP so an assistant reads and acts on the same live document."}]]}]
4c:["$","$L4b","post-flora-alternative",{"post":{"_key":"post-flora-alternative","slug":"flora-alternative","category":"comparisons","title":"The best Flora alternative for creative teams","isoDate":"2026-07-21","date":"July 21, 2026","readTime":"6 Min Read","excerpt":"Looking for a Flora alternative? Flora (Florafauna) and Melius are the two node canvases most often compared, so \"we have a canvas and an agent\" isn't the difference. The real gaps are collaboration, learning curve, and pricing. Here's how Melius handles the same work with true real-time multiplayer.","image":{"url":"/images/blog/flora-alternative/cover.webp"},"authors":[{"name":"Alex Chen, Member of Technical Staff"}],"faq":[{"question":"What is the best Flora alternative?","answer":"Melius is the closest and strongest Flora alternative. Both are node-based creative canvases that aggregate many models, pair a canvas with an AI agent, and offer real-time multiplayer, so the decision comes down to execution: Melius adds an agent that also runs in Slack, several agents working at once with visible presence, a gentler learning curve because Mel does the node-wiring for you, and every model under one credit pool."},{"question":"How is Melius different from Flora?","answer":"Both have a node canvas, an agent and real-time multiplayer, so the honest differences are concrete. Melius has been stress-tested past 200 nodes on one canvas, where teams report Flora's canvas starting to strain; every asset you generate is semantically searchable instead of filed away to scroll; and the agent runs the full request-to-download loop in Slack with several agents working at once, rather than a single browser-tab assistant."},{"question":"Does Melius have as many models as Flora?","answer":"Both platforms give you the major frontier image, video and audio models in one place, including the Flux family, Nano Banana Pro, Seedream, Kling, Veo, Sora and Seedance. Neither locks you to a single provider; you pick the right model per node."},{"question":"Is Flora the same as Florafauna?","answer":"Yes. Flora is the product from Florafauna (florafauna.ai), and its built-in agent is named FAUNA. When people compare a Flora alternative, they mean this node-based canvas. Melius is the closest like-for-like: a node canvas plus an agent, but with an agent that also runs in Slack and concurrently, a gentler learning curve, and one shared credit pool."},{"question":"Is Melius easier to learn than Flora?","answer":"It aims to be. Flora is explicitly pitched at technical teams comfortable with node systems, and reviewers suggest budgeting a full day before you're productive. Melius keeps the same node power but lets Mel build and wire the graph from a brief, so you can steer in plain language instead of assembling every node by hand."},{"question":"Can Melius handle video work?","answer":"Yes. Melius routes to frontier video models and includes an in-app multi-track editor to assemble the result. Because every model shares one credit pool, you can compare a shot across Kling, Veo and Seedance without juggling separate budgets."}],"tableOfContents":[{"_key":"what-flora-does-well","title":"What Flora does well"},{"_key":"where-teams-hit-friction","title":"The friction"},{"_key":"how-melius-approaches-the-same-work","title":"The Melius approach"},{"_key":"who-should-switch","title":"Who should switch"},{"_key":"frequently-asked-questions","title":"FAQ"}],"content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b933","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b932","text":"Flora and Melius are the two tools most often mentioned in the same breath, and for good reason. Both are node-based creative canvases: you drop text, image, video and audio nodes onto an infinite canvas, wire them together, and build reusable pipelines instead of typing into a single prompt box. Both aggregate dozens of frontier models, and both pair the canvas with an AI agent, FAUNA on Flora, Mel on Melius.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b937","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b934","text":"So a ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b935","text":"Flora alternative","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b936","text":" comparison can't lean on \"we have a canvas\", \"we have an agent\" or \"we have multiplayer\", because Flora has all three. The real differences are in execution: how far the agent reaches, the learning curve, and how each one is assembled.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b939","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b938","text":"What Flora does well","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"what-flora-does-well"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b941","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b940","text":"Flora is a polished, capable tool. Its Style DNA system keeps a look or character consistent across generations, its model coverage is broad, and its build-once, reuse-forever workflows are genuinely powerful for studios producing at scale. It has earned real clients in film, fashion and branding. If you have a technical team that enjoys wiring node graphs by hand, Flora rewards that.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b943","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b942","text":"Where teams hit friction","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"where-teams-hit-friction"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b946","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b944","text":"The agent is the headline, and the soft spot. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b945","text":"On paper FAUNA is a full canvas agent. In practice, reviewers and users report it often needs correcting on multi-step briefs, and it lives only in the browser tab, no Slack, no concurrent agents, no team-taught skills. It exists; the question is how much it actually carries.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b949","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b947","text":"A steep learning curve. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b948","text":"Flora explicitly targets teams comfortable with node-based systems, and reviewers suggest investing a full day before you're productive, even if you already know Figma.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b952","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b950","text":"A canvas that stalls as it grows. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b951","text":"Flora is fine on small graphs, but teams report it bogging down as a project scales, well before the node counts a real multi-scene campaign reaches, so the canvas becomes the ceiling.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b955","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b953","text":"Files to browse, not assets to search. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b954","text":"Flora keeps your outputs in a file library, but there's no semantic search, so finding the shot you made last week means scrolling, not describing it.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b957","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b956","text":"How Melius approaches the same work","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"how-melius-approaches-the-same-work"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b959","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b958","text":"Both tools have a node canvas, an agent and multiplayer, so the honest comparison is the concrete places they diverge, not who has an agent.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b962","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b960","text":"Scale that holds up past 50 nodes. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b961","text":"Melius has been stress-tested past 200 nodes on a single canvas, so a multi-scene project stays responsive as the graph fills up, exactly where teams report Flora's canvas starting to strain.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b965","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b963","text":"Search with AI. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b964","text":"Every generation and upload is auto-indexed by what is actually in it, so you can search \"the neon product shot on black\" and land on it. Flora gives you files to scroll; there is no semantic search over your own library.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b968","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b966","text":"The agent works where Flora's can't. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b967","text":"FAUNA lives in a single browser tab, one agent, one step at a time. Mel runs the full request-approve-download loop inside Slack, and several agents can work the same canvas at once with visible presence, so the difference isn't 'has an agent', it's how far it reaches and how many run.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b971","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b969","text":"Teach it your brand once. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b970","text":"Store brand instructions plus reference images and save custom slash-command skills, and the agent applies them to every generation, instead of re-selecting reference nodes each turn.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b977","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b974","href":"/blog/one-subscription-every-model","isNewTab":false}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b972","text":"Every model, one subscription. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b973","text":"Image, video and audio models share ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b975","text":"a single subscription","marks":["b974"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b976","text":" with unlimited agent usage, so comparing a shot across Kling, Veo and Seedance is a routing choice, not a budgeting headache.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"portableTable","_key":"b978","rows":[{"_key":"b979","cells":[{"_key":"b980","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b982","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b981","text":"","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b983","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b985","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b984","text":"Melius","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b986","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b988","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b987","text":"Flora","marks":["strong"]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b989","cells":[{"_key":"b990","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b992","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b991","text":"Node-based canvas + agent","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b993","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b995","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b994","text":"Yes","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b996","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b998","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b997","text":"Yes (FAUNA)","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b999","cells":[{"_key":"b1000","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1002","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1001","text":"Canvas scale","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1003","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1005","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1004","text":"Stress-tested past 200 nodes","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1006","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1008","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1007","text":"Strains as the graph grows","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1009","cells":[{"_key":"b1010","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1012","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1011","text":"Find your own assets","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1013","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1015","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1014","text":"Semantic asset search","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1016","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1018","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1017","text":"File library, no semantic search","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1019","cells":[{"_key":"b1020","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1022","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1021","text":"Agent in Slack","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1023","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1025","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1024","text":"Full workflow in a thread","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1026","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1028","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1027","text":"Browser tab only","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1029","cells":[{"_key":"b1030","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1032","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1031","text":"Multiple agents at once","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1033","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1035","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1034","text":"Yes, with visible presence","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1036","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1038","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1037","text":"One at a time","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1039","cells":[{"_key":"b1040","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1042","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1041","text":"Team-taught brand","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1043","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1045","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1044","text":"Context + slash skills","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1046","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1048","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1047","text":"Saved styles / per-turn refs","marks":[]}]}]}]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1050","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1049","text":"Who should switch","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"who-should-switch"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1052","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1051","text":"Flora is a strong tool for a technical team that lives in node graphs. If your team needs an agent that reliably carries multi-step work into Slack, several agents on one canvas at once, and brand taught once as reusable skills, Melius is built for exactly that.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1057","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1054","href":"https://app.melius.com","isNewTab":true}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1053","text":"Try the canvas with your own team. ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1055","text":"Open Melius","marks":["b1054"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1056","text":".","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1059","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1058","text":"Frequently asked questions","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"frequently-asked-questions"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1064","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1061","href":"/blog/best-ai-creative-canvases-image-generation","isNewTab":false}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1060","text":"For a broader comparison, read our guide to ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1062","text":"the best AI creative canvases for image generation","marks":["b1061"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1063","text":".","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"faqList","_key":"b1065","items":"$4c:props:post:faq"}]}}]
4d:["$","$L4b","post-magnific-alternative",{"post":{"_key":"post-magnific-alternative","slug":"magnific-alternative","category":"comparisons","title":"The best Magnific alternative for upscaling and creative AI","isoDate":"2026-07-21","date":"July 21, 2026","readTime":"6 Min Read","excerpt":"Looking for a Magnific alternative? Magnific's creative upscaler is a strong specialist, but if upscaling is one step in a real production, not the whole tool, and you'd rather not pay premium rates for a no-refund, credit-metered enhancer, here's how Melius folds generation, editing, resizing and assembly onto one canvas.","image":{"url":"/images/blog/magnific-alternative/cover.webp"},"authors":[{"name":"Alex Chen, Member of Technical Staff"}],"faq":[{"question":"What is the best Magnific alternative?","answer":"Melius is the strongest alternative for teams. Magnific is a capable, well-funded platform, a real node canvas with an in-canvas agent, a timeline editor and model training on top of its best-in-class upscaler, so this isn't a canvas-versus-no-canvas comparison. The wedge is agent reach: on Melius the agent also runs inside Slack, the MCP is canvas-level so an external agent can build and run the canvas itself, teams teach it their brand as reusable slash-command skills, and self-serve plans include up to 8 seats, Enterprise includes unlimited seats, and agent usage is unlimited."},{"question":"Does Melius upscale and resize images like Magnific?","answer":"Yes. Melius includes magic resize and image enhancement as steps on the canvas, alongside background removal and other edits. The difference is that these live inside an end-to-end workflow: generate, edit, resize and hand off, rather than a standalone upscaler you round-trip through."},{"question":"Why do people look for a Magnific alternative?","answer":"Commonly cited reasons: it is priced at the premium end with no free trial and a strict no-refund policy, its creative upscaling can \"overcook\" images and invent detail that drifts from the original, and heavy trial-and-error burns credits. Its agent and MCP are also generation-focused rather than driving the canvas remotely, and there is no native Slack workflow, so teams that want an agent reaching across their whole stack look elsewhere."},{"question":"How does Magnific AI work?","answer":"Magnific is a creative upscaler: you feed it an image and it enlarges it while inventing plausible new detail, texture and lighting, with sliders to control how much it reimagines versus preserves the original. That hallucination is its strength and its risk, which is why control over how much it changes the image matters. In Melius, upscaling and enhancement are connected nodes in a larger pipeline rather than a standalone round trip."},{"question":"Is Magnific's upscaler better than Melius?","answer":"Magnific's creative upscaler is genuinely strong at inventing plausible detail, and for pure maximum-detail upscaling it is a specialist worth using. Melius optimizes for the whole creative pipeline instead of one step, so the question is less which upscaler wins and more whether you want a standalone enhancer or a workspace where enhancement is one connected node."},{"question":"Does Melius have a canvas?","answer":"Yes. Melius is built canvas-first: a node-based canvas where prompts, images, video and audio are connected nodes, with Mel to plan and wire the work and real-time multiplayer for teams."}],"tableOfContents":[{"_key":"what-magnific-does-well","title":"What Magnific does well"},{"_key":"where-teams-hit-friction","title":"The friction"},{"_key":"how-melius-approaches-the-same-work","title":"The Melius approach"},{"_key":"who-should-switch","title":"Who should switch"},{"_key":"frequently-asked-questions","title":"FAQ"}],"content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1067","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1066","text":"Magnific made its name as a creative upscaler, and it is still one of the best at it: push an image through and it doesn't just enlarge, it invents plausible new detail, texture and lighting, with sliders to dial how much it reimagines versus preserves.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1071","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1068","text":"It is no longer only an upscaler, though. Backed by Freepik's platform it has grown into a genuine node canvas with an in-canvas agent, a timeline video editor and model training, which makes it one of the closest tools to Melius in shape. So a ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1069","text":"Magnific alternative","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1070","text":" comparison can't lean on \"we have a canvas and an agent\" either. The honest differences are how far the agent reaches, how a team works on it at once, and how it plugs into your own stack. Here's a fair look.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1073","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1072","text":"What Magnific does well","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"what-magnific-does-well"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1075","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1074","text":"Magnific's creative upscaling is best-in-class at inventing detail, and its Mystic model, Relight tools and model training give real control over texture, lighting and consistency. Beyond that it now runs a live node canvas with multiplayer, an agent that wires and runs nodes, a timeline video editor and a huge stock library. It is a capable, well-funded platform, not a one-trick upscaler, and worth taking seriously.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1077","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1076","text":"Where teams hit friction","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"where-teams-hit-friction"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1080","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1078","text":"The agent and MCP stop at generation. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1079","text":"Its MCP and integrations are described as generating assets rather than building or running the canvas remotely, and there's no native Slack workflow, so an external agent can make images but can't operate the canvas end to end for you.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1083","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1081","text":"Deterministic flows, not team skills. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1082","text":"Customization runs through preset flows rather than natural-language, team-defined slash-command skills, so teaching the agent your brand voice as reusable commands isn't really the model.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1086","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1084","text":"Detail that drifts. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1085","text":"The same hallucination that makes the upscaler impressive can \"overcook\" an image, inventing detail that diverges from the original, especially on photorealistic portraits.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1089","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1087","text":"Premium pricing, no free trial. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1088","text":"Users report no free tier to test with and a strict no-refund policy, so evaluating it means paying up front, and heavy trial-and-error burns credits.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1091","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1090","text":"How Melius approaches the same work","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"how-melius-approaches-the-same-work"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1093","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1092","text":"Melius and Magnific overlap more than most pairs in this list, so the differences are about how far the agent reaches, not whether one exists.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1096","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1094","text":"An agent that reaches past the canvas. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1095","text":"Mel plans and runs multi-step work on the canvas and also inside Slack, so a request, an approval and a finished download can happen in the thread where briefs actually arrive, not only in the app.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1099","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1097","text":"A canvas-level MCP. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1098","text":"An external agent like Claude can build and run the Melius canvas itself, creating nodes, wiring them and executing, rather than only calling a generation endpoint. That's the difference between an agent that operates your workspace and one that just returns assets.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1102","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1100","text":"Teach it your brand, run many at once. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1101","text":"Give the agent brand instructions plus reference images and save custom slash-command skills, then run several agents concurrently with visible presence on the canvas, personalization and a workforce, not a single assistant.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1111","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1105","href":"/blog/best-ai-photo-background-editing-tools","isNewTab":false},{"_type":"link","_key":"b1108","href":"/blog/one-subscription-every-model","isNewTab":false}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1103","text":"Resize and enhance in-line, one subscription. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1104","text":"Magic resize, image enhancement and ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1106","text":"background removal","marks":["b1105"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1107","text":" live as nodes, so an upscale flows straight into the next step, and every image, video and audio model shares ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1109","text":"one subscription","marks":["b1108"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1110","text":" with up to 8 seats on self-serve plans, unlimited seats on Enterprise, and unlimited agent usage.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1114","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1112","text":"Your own work, semantically searchable. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1113","text":"Past Magnific's stock library, every image you generate or upload is auto-indexed by content, so you find your own past work by describing it rather than remembering a filename or re-upscaling from scratch.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"portableTable","_key":"b1115","rows":[{"_key":"b1116","cells":[{"_key":"b1117","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1119","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1118","text":"","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b1120","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1122","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1121","text":"Melius","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b1123","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1125","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1124","text":"Magnific","marks":["strong"]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1126","cells":[{"_key":"b1127","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1129","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1128","text":"Core focus","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1130","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1132","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1131","text":"Agent-run creative workspace","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1133","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1135","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1134","text":"Upscaling heritage, now a full suite","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1136","cells":[{"_key":"b1137","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1139","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1138","text":"Node canvas + in-canvas agent","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1140","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1142","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1141","text":"Yes","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1143","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1145","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1144","text":"Yes","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1146","cells":[{"_key":"b1147","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1149","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1148","text":"Agent in Slack","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1150","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1152","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1151","text":"Full workflow in a thread","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1153","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1155","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1154","text":"Not native","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1156","cells":[{"_key":"b1157","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1159","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1158","text":"Canvas-level MCP","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1160","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1162","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1161","text":"Builds & runs the canvas","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1163","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1165","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1164","text":"Generation-only","marks":[]}]}]}]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1167","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1166","text":"Who should switch","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"who-should-switch"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1169","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1168","text":"If your job is squeezing maximum detail out of a single image, or you want the deepest timeline video editing, Magnific is a strong, well-funded choice and worth keeping in the toolbox. If the bottleneck is throughput across a team, an agent that runs the workflow in Slack and on the canvas, is drivable from your own AI tools, and learns your brand as reusable skills, Melius reaches further with up to 8 seats on self-serve plans, unlimited seats on Enterprise, and unlimited agent usage.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1174","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1171","href":"https://app.melius.com","isNewTab":true}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1170","text":"Put your whole workflow on one canvas. ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1172","text":"Open Melius","marks":["b1171"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1173","text":".","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1176","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1175","text":"Frequently asked questions","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"frequently-asked-questions"},{"_type":"faqList","_key":"b1177","items":"$4d:props:post:faq"}]}}]
